{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900310/extras/7ed60beb1ac2aba65fd441a49edf0bae.avif?t=1769142438\" width=780 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards command the Three Kingdoms, conquer the world! Three Kingdoms: The Records Reborn \u2013 <strong>Muster your Generals! Deploy your Formations! Harness the Earth and Command the Heavens! Plot your path to the Throne!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plan Before You Move:</strong> Dive into deep tactical card warfare. Craft the ultimate deck and execute your grand strategy to crush the competition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heroes of the Era:</strong> Hundreds of exquisitely illustrated cards await. From wily strategists to mighty warriors, witness the true essence of the Three Kingdoms heroes brought to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heaven\u2019s Time, Earth\u2019s Advantage:</strong> Turn the tides of war by mastering 5 distinct Weather conditions and 5 Terrain types. Use the environment to corner your enemy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Pen and The Sword:</strong> Victory has many faces. Ascend to power through &quot;Civil Administration&quot; or &quot;Martial Prowess.&quot; diverse strategic paths lead to the same glory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Versatile Gameplay:</strong> Enjoy a rich, immersive Solo mode, or challenge a rival in a fierce 1v1 duel to see who is the true ruler of the land!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3900310?t=1769142438","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3900310?t=1769142438","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_